<div class="wrap dash qr-admin"><div class="page-kicker">GESTÃO DE SALÃO</div><div class="page-title-row"><div><h2>Mesas — QR Code</h2><p>Crie, imprima e vincule cada QR Code a uma mesa do salão.</p></div><button class="qr-print-all" onclick="window.print()">🖨 Imprimir todos</button></div><div class="qr-toolbar"><form method="post" action="?r=table_add"><input name="numero" maxlength="15" placeholder="Número ou nome da mesa" required><button>+ Criar mesa</button></form><span><?= count($tables) ?> mesas cadastradas</span></div><div class="qr-table-grid"><?php foreach($tables as $t): ?><article class="qr-table-card"><div class="qr-code" id="qr<?= $t['id'] ?>"></div><div><h3>Mesa <?= e($t['numero']) ?></h3><small>Pedido vinculado automaticamente</small><div class="qr-actions"><a href="?r=placa&mesa=<?= urlencode($t['numero']) ?>" target="_blank">Imprimir placa</a><form method="post" action="?r=table_delete" onsubmit="return confirm('Excluir esta mesa?')"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= $t['id'] ?>"><button>Excluir</button></form></div></div></article><?php endforeach; ?><form class="qr-add-card" method="post" action="?r=table_add"><b>⊕ Criar mesa com QR Code</b><span>Adicione outra mesa ao salão</span><input name="numero" maxlength="15" placeholder="Ex: 10 ou Varanda" required><button>Criar</button></form></div></div><script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcodejs/1.0.0/qrcode.min.js"></script><script>const base=location.origin+'/cardapio/?r=menu&mesa=';<?php foreach($tables as $t): ?>new QRCode(document.getElementById('qr<?= $t['id'] ?>'),{text:base+<?= json_encode($t['numero']) ?>,width:92,height:92});<?php endforeach; ?></script>
